L CONSTRAINTS CONTINUE TO IMPACT MARKET.MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL - INCURRED SUBSTANTIAL OPERATING LOSSES IN MARCH."}{'symbol': 'MDLZ', 'date': '2020-03-27 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Mondelez Enters Into Revolving Credit Agreement For A 364-Day Senior Unsecured Revolving Credit Facility Of $1.75 Bln', 'text': 'MONDELEZ - ON MARCH 24, ENTERED INTO REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT FOR A 364-DAY SENIOR UNSECURED REVOLVING CREDIT FACILITY OF $1.75 BILLION.MONDELEZ - 364-DAY REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT WILL TERMINATE ON MARCH 23, 2021.MONDELEZ -CO MAY REQUEST AMOUNT OF REVOLVING FACILITY BE INCREASED BY UP TO $1 BILLION WITH AGREEMENT OF LENDERS PROVIDING INCREASED COMMITMENTS.'}{'symbol': 'NUE', 'date': '2020-03-27 12:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Nucor Corp Says CEO John J. Ferriola's 2019 Total Compensation Was $19.1 Million", 'text': "NUCOR CORP SAYS CEO  JOHN J. FERRIOLA'S 2019 TOTAL COMPENSATION WAS $19.1 MILLION VERSUS $15.6 MILLION IN 2018 – SEC FILING.NUCOR CORP SAYS CFO  JAMES D. FRIAS' 2019 TOTAL COMPENSATION WAS $6.1 MILLION VERSUS $5.4 MILLION IN 2018 – SEC FILING.NUCOR CORP - FOR 2019, RATIO OF CEO FERRIOLA’S ANNUAL TOTAL COMPENSATION TO MEDIAN EMPLOYEE’S ANNUAL TOTAL COMPENSATION WAS 218 TO 1."}{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2020-03-27 14:30:00-04:56', 'title': "S. Africa's Competition Commission Conditionally Approves Proposed Merger Whereby UpJohn Intends To Acquire Mylan", 'text': "S. AFRICA'S COMPETITION COMMISSION - COMMISSION HAS CONDITIONALLY APPROVED PROPOSED MERGER WHEREBY UPJOHN INC. (NEWCO) INTENDS TO ACQUIRE MYLAN."}{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2020-03-27 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Alphamab Oncology Announces Clinical Supply Collaboration With Pfizer On Kn026 In Combination With Ibrance(R) (Palbociclib)', 'text': 'ALPHAMAB ONCOLOGY ANNOUNCES CLINICAL SUPPLY COLLABORATION WITH PFIZER ON KN026 IN COMBINATION WITH IBRANCE(R) (PALBOCICLIB).ALPHAMAB ONCOLOGY - HAS ENTERED CLINICAL SUPPLY AGREEMENT WITH PFIZER TO ADVANCE CLINICAL STUDY TO INVESTIGATE KN026 IN COMBINATI